"Data Enrichment": "## Doing it responsibly\n- Prefer sources you can explain, such as public registries and company websites.\n- Verify anything inferred before you rely on it.\n- Keep a note of where each detail came from.",
"Waterfall Enrichment": "## Setting it up\n- Order the sources from most to least reliable.\n- Stop as soon as a source returns a confident answer.\n- Verify the final result, whichever source it came from.\n- Log which source answered each record, so you can see which sources earn their place.\n- Keep the order under review as source quality changes.",
"Data Decay": "## Slowing it down\n- Re-verify on a regular schedule.\n- Remove records after repeated bounces.\n- Ask contacts to update their details when you can.",
