"Trigger Email": "## Getting it right\n- Send immediately after the action.\n- Keep it short and specific.\n- Make sure it is accurate, because people read these closely.",
"Data Privacy": "## Good habits\n- Collect only what you need.\n- Keep a record of why you hold each type of data.\n- Make it easy for people to ask for removal.",
"GDPR": "## Practical points\n- Know your lawful basis before you contact anyone.\n- Tell people clearly who you are and where you got their details.\n- Respond to access and deletion requests on time.",
